.TH openalex-snapshot-index 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot-index \- build lookup index parquet
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot index
[OPTIONS]
.SH EXAMPLE
openalex-snapshot index --root-dir /data --dataset works --profile balanced
.SH DEFAULTS
dataset defaults to `all`.
With `--dataset all`, existing per-dataset index files are skipped and `--index-file` is ignored.
